#: ../developer/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference is MIT-licensed (see `LICENSE`) and contributions are "
"welcome. This page covers the checks a change must pass and how to "
"propose it."
msgstr "HybridInference 采用 MIT 许可证（见 `LICENSE`），欢迎贡献。本页说明改动必须通过哪些检查，以及如何提交改动。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:6
msgid "Getting set up"
msgstr "环境准备"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:17
msgid ""
"Replace `yourname` with your GitHub username. To keep your main checkout "
"free, create the branch in a [worktree](https://git-scm.com/docs/git-"
"worktree) instead: `git worktree add -b <branch> "
"../hybridinference-<feature> upstream/dev`. If you cloned upstream rather"
" than a fork, start from `origin/dev` and push to your fork remote."
msgstr ""
"把 `yourname` 换成你的 GitHub 用户名。为了不占用主检出目录，可以改在 [worktree](https://git-"
"scm.com/docs/git-worktree) 中创建分支：`git worktree add -b <branch> "
"../hybridinference-<feature> upstream/dev`。如果你克隆的是上游仓库而不是 fork，请从 "
"`origin/dev` 开始，并推送到你的 fork 远端。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:23
msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv` on Python 3.12, installs the project "
"editable with the `dev` dependency group, and installs the pre-commit "
"hooks; [Installation](installation.md) has the full prerequisites. Every "
"`make` target that runs Python goes through `uv run`; override it if you "
"need to, for example `make lint UV_RUN=\"uv run --active\"`."
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 用 Python 3.12 创建 `.venv`，以可编辑方式安装本项目及 `dev` 依赖组，并安装 pre-"
"commit 钩子；完整的前置条件见[安装](installation.md)。所有运行 Python 的 `make` 目标都经由 `uv "
"run`；需要时可以覆盖它，例如 `make lint UV_RUN=\"uv run --active\"`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:29
msgid "Your first contribution"
msgstr "完成第一次贡献"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:31
msgid ""
"Run the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md) or the [source development "
"setup](installation.md#development-checkout-no-docker) first, so you can "
"tell a failure your change causes from a setup problem. A local example "
"deployment is enough. Pick a small reproducible bug, an uncovered "
"configuration case or a confusing instruction, and search the issues and "
"tests first. For a larger feature, open a feature request to agree on the"
" behavior before writing it."
msgstr ""
"先运行[快速上手](router-tutorial.md)或[源码开发环境](installation.md#development-"
"checkout-no-docker)，这样才能分清失败是你的改动造成的，还是环境问题。一个本地示例部署就够了。挑一个小而可复现的 "
"bug、一个未覆盖的配置场景或一段令人困惑的说明，并先搜索 issue 和已有测试。较大的功能请先提交功能请求，在动手之前就行为达成一致。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For a first exercise, test a routing-policy endpoint that uses an "
"environment-variable default, such as "
"`${TEST_ROUTING_ENDPOINT:-https://default.example}`. Read "
"`_expand_env_value` and `load_routing_config` in "
"`apps/backend/routing/config.py`, and the tests in "
"`tests/unit/routing/test_config.py`. The gateway keeps its routing policy"
" in the database as JSON; `load_routing_config` parses the same structure"
" from a file, which keeps the test self-contained. An unset variable "
"should give the default URL, and a set one should override it:"
msgstr ""
"作为第一个练习，可以测试一个使用环境变量默认值的路由策略端点，例如 "
"`${TEST_ROUTING_ENDPOINT:-https://default.example}`。阅读 "
"`apps/backend/routing/config.py` 中的 `_expand_env_value` 和 "
"`load_routing_config`，以及 `tests/unit/routing/test_config.py` "
"中的测试。网关把路由策略以 JSON 形式保存在数据库中；`load_routing_config` "
"从文件解析同样的结构，这让测试可以自成一体。未设置变量时应得到默认 URL，设置后应覆盖它："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:67
msgid ""
"Add it only if the case is still uncovered. For a bug fix, make the "
"regression test fail on the original code first, then change the smallest"
" responsible function until it passes. Run the focused tests while "
"editing:"
msgstr ""
"只有在该场景尚未被覆盖时才添加这个测试。修复 bug "
"时，先让回归测试在原始代码上失败，再修改最小的相关函数，直到测试通过。编辑过程中运行针对性的测试："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:75
msgid ""
"For a runtime change, repeat the affected request against your local "
"gateway. With the Quickstart's example running, `make build s=backend "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` rebuilds the backend, and `make smoke "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` checks health, the model list and a routed "
"completion. A passing smoke does not show that your bug is fixed, so "
"exercise the changed behavior too."
msgstr ""
"对于运行时改动，请在本地网关上重放受影响的请求。快速上手的示例运行时，`make build s=backend "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` 会重新构建后端，`make smoke DISTRIBUTION=example` "
"会检查健康状态、模型列表和一次经路由的补全。冒烟测试通过并不说明你的 bug 已修复，所以也要实际验证改动后的行为。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:81
msgid ""
"Before opening the pull request, run `make format`, `make lint` and `make"
" test`, plus the [frontend](#frontend) or [documentation](#documentation)"
" checks when relevant, and review `git diff`. Push to your fork and open "
"a pull request against upstream `dev`, with a title such as "
"`test(routing): cover endpoint environment defaults`. In the template, "
"list the behavior covered and the checks you ran; for a bug fix, add the "
"reproduction and the before and after result."
msgstr ""
"提交 pull request 之前，运行 `make format`、`make lint` 和 `make "
"test`，相关时再运行[前端](#frontend)或[文档](#documentation)检查，并检查 `git diff`。推送到你的 "
"fork，向上游 `dev` 提交 pull request，标题例如 `test(routing): cover endpoint "
"environment defaults`。在模板中列出覆盖的行为和你运行过的检查；修复 bug 时，附上复现步骤和修复前后的结果。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:89
msgid "Repository layout"
msgstr "仓库结构"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:120
msgid ""
"The backend packages, `serving` and `routing`, are rooted at "
"`apps/backend`. `make setup-dev` installs them into `.venv`; outside it, "
"set `PYTHONPATH=apps/backend`."
msgstr ""
"后端包 `serving` 和 `routing` 的根目录是 `apps/backend`。`make setup-dev` 会把它们安装进 "
"`.venv`；在该环境之外，请设置 `PYTHONPATH=apps/backend`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:124
msgid "Quality gates"
msgstr "质量门禁"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "What it runs"
msgstr "执行什么"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`make format`"
msgstr "`make format`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`ruff format .`, then `ruff check --fix --unsafe-fixes .`"
msgstr "`ruff format .`，然后 `ruff check --fix --unsafe-fixes .`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`make lint`"
msgstr "`make lint`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`ruff format --check .`, `ruff check --no-fix .`, `pydocstyle`"
msgstr "`ruff format --check .`、`ruff check --no-fix .`、`pydocstyle`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`make test`"
msgstr "`make test`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`pytest -m \"not external and not dbtest\" -n auto --dist loadfile`"
msgstr "`pytest -m \"not external and not dbtest\" -n auto --dist loadfile`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`make check`"
msgstr "`make check`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`lint` + `test`"
msgstr "`lint` + `test`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`make all`"
msgstr "`make all`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`format` + `check`"
msgstr "`format` + `check`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:134
msgid ""
"Nothing type-checks the backend. Tooling enforces style: ruff (line "
"length 100, target `py311`, rules `E`, `W`, `F`, `I`, `UP`, `B`, `C4`, "
"`SIM`, `TCH` and `RUF`) and pydocstyle (Google convention), which skips "
"`tests`, `.venv`, `node_modules`, `apps/frontend`, `ops` and `docs` and "
"so enforces docstrings in `apps/backend`."
msgstr ""
"后端没有任何类型检查。代码风格由工具强制：ruff（行宽 100，目标 `py311`，规则 "
"`E`、`W`、`F`、`I`、`UP`、`B`、`C4`、`SIM`、`TCH` 和 `RUF`）和 pydocstyle（Google "
"风格）；pydocstyle 跳过 `tests`、`.venv`、`node_modules`、`apps/frontend`、`ops` 和 "
"`docs`，因此会强制 `apps/backend` 中的 docstring。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:141
msgid ""
"The pre-commit hooks (`pre-commit run --all-files` runs them on the whole"
" tree) cover ruff at the version CI uses, pydocstyle, `gitleaks` secret "
"scanning, the standard whitespace, YAML, JSON and TOML checks, and eslint"
" and prettier for `apps/frontend`."
msgstr ""
"pre-commit 钩子（`pre-commit run --all-files` 会在整个仓库上运行它们）包括与 CI 相同版本的 "
"ruff、pydocstyle、`gitleaks` 秘密扫描、标准的空白符以及 YAML、JSON、TOML 检查，还有针对 "
"`apps/frontend` 的 eslint 和 prettier。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:146
msgid ""
"Before opening a pull request, run `make format` and make sure `make "
"test` passes."
msgstr "开 PR 之前，先跑 `make format`，并确认 `make test` 通过。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:149
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:151
msgid ""
"A test's marker decides its tier; the directories are a convention. The "
"markers declared in `pyproject.toml` are `unit`, `integration`, "
"`external` and `dbtest`, and `--strict-markers` makes any other marker an"
" error."
msgstr ""
"测试属于哪一层由它的 marker 决定；目录只是约定。`pyproject.toml` 中声明的 marker 有 "
"`unit`、`integration`、`external` 和 `dbtest`，而 `--strict-markers` 会让其他任何 "
"marker 报错。"

