msgstr "服务器 / 可观测性"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`tests/servers/`, `tests/observability/`"
msgstr "`tests/servers/`、`tests/observability/`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Needs a live Postgres"
msgstr "需要能连上的 Postgres"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "mostly `tests/integration/`"
msgstr "主要在 `tests/integration/`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
