#: ../developer/contributing.md:163
msgid ""
"`testpaths` is `[\"tests\", \"distributions\"]`, so tests an overlay "
"ships run in the default suite too."
msgstr ""
"`testpaths` 为 `[\"tests\", \"distributions\"]`，因此 overlay "
"自带的测试也会在默认测试集中运行。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:178
msgid ""
"The `dbtest` tier needs PostgreSQL. With Docker, `make test-db-local` "
"needs no setup: it starts one container for the whole machine "
"(`hybridinference-test-postgres` on `127.0.0.1:54329`, data in memory), "
"gives each checkout its own database, prepares it, and runs the tier with"
" one worker per CPU, up to eight. The container and databases are kept, "
"so a re-run takes about 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"`dbtest` 层需要 PostgreSQL。有 Docker 时，`make test-db-local` "
"无需任何准备：它为整台机器启动一个容器（`hybridinference-test-postgres`，监听 "
"`127.0.0.1:54329`，数据保存在内存中），为每个检出目录创建独立的数据库并完成准备，再以每个 CPU 一个 "
"worker（最多八个）运行这一层。容器和数据库会保留，因此再次运行大约只需 15 秒。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:194
msgid ""
"Otherwise, every test finds the database through "
"`tests/fixtures/postgres.py`, from `TEST_DB_HOST`, `TEST_DB_PORT`, "
"`TEST_DB_USER`, `TEST_DB_PASSWORD` and `TEST_DB_NAME` (defaults "
"`localhost:5432`, `postgres`/`postgres`, `hybridinference_test_db`). "
"Starting the database container is enough:"
msgstr ""
"否则，每个测试都通过 `tests/fixtures/postgres.py` 找到数据库，读取 "
"`TEST_DB_HOST`、`TEST_DB_PORT`、`TEST_DB_USER`、`TEST_DB_PASSWORD` 和 "
"`TEST_DB_NAME`（默认分别为 `localhost:5432`、`postgres`/`postgres` 和 "
"`hybridinference_test_db`）。只启动数据库容器就够了："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:203
msgid ""
"Each test process creates and migrates its own database on first use; `uv"
" run python -m tests.fixtures.postgres prepare --workers N` does it up "
"front before a run with `-n N`. `make test-db` sets `TEST_DB_REQUIRED=1`,"
" as CI does: a database test that cannot connect then fails instead of "
"skipping, and `TEST_DB_HOST` and `TEST_DB_PORT` must be set."
msgstr ""
"每个测试进程在第一次使用时创建并迁移自己的数据库；在用 `-n N` 运行之前，`uv run python -m "
"tests.fixtures.postgres prepare --workers N` 会提前完成这一步。`make test-db` 与 CI"
" 一样设置 `TEST_DB_REQUIRED=1`：此时连不上数据库的测试会失败而不是跳过，并且必须设置 `TEST_DB_HOST` 和 "
"`TEST_DB_PORT`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:209
msgid ""
"`make test` runs files in parallel. Run serially to debug one failure, "
"but check a suspected environment leak under `-n auto` as well: leaks "
"between files show up only in the parallel run."
msgstr ""
"`make test` 会并行运行测试文件。调试单个失败时请串行运行，但怀疑是环境变量泄漏时，也要在 `-n auto` "
"下检查：文件之间的泄漏只在并行运行时出现。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:213
msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "前端"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:215
msgid "The console's gates are separate from the Python ones:"
msgstr "控制台的门禁与 Python 那套是分开的："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:227
msgid ""
"CI also runs `npm run format:check` (prettier) and `npm audit --omit=dev "
"--audit-level=high` in `apps/frontend`."
msgstr ""
"CI 还会在 `apps/frontend` 中运行 `npm run format:check`（prettier）和 `npm audit "
"--omit=dev --audit-level=high`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:230
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:232
msgid ""
"These pages are MyST Markdown built by Sphinx from `docs/developer/`, "
"with `docs/developer/index.rst` as the root toctree. Before pushing, run "
"the checks CI runs:"
msgstr ""
"这些页面是 MyST Markdown，由 Sphinx 从 `docs/developer/` 构建，根 toctree 是 "
"`docs/developer/index.rst`。推送之前，运行 CI 所做的检查："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:240
msgid ""
"It builds the English and Chinese sites with warnings as errors, checks "
"local links, and checks that no translation has fallen back to English. "
"`make docs` builds the site alone. Add a new page to "
"`docs/developer/index.rst`; an orphan page is a warning, and warnings "
"fail the build."
msgstr ""
"它以警告即错误的方式构建英文和中文站点，检查本地链接，并检查没有译文悄悄退回英文。`make docs` 只构建站点。新增页面要加入 "
"`docs/developer/index.rst`；孤立页面会产生警告，而警告会使构建失败。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:245
msgid "Writing a page"
msgstr "撰写页面"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:247
msgid "Most readers arrive from a search or the sidebar with one task in mind:"
msgstr "大多数读者从搜索或侧边栏进来，心里只有一个任务："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:249
msgid ""
"**Say who the page is for and what they can do after reading it**, in the"
" first paragraph."
msgstr "**说明页面写给谁、读完之后能做什么**，放在第一段。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:251
msgid ""
"**Lead with the action or the answer.** Put exceptions and edge cases "
"after it, and do not open a section with what the software lacks."
msgstr "**先给出操作或答案。** 例外和边界情况放在后面，也不要用软件缺少什么来开头。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:253
msgid ""
"**Name a file only when the reader will open or edit it.** Do not cite "
"functions or line numbers to prove a statement; tests and review do that."
msgstr "**只有读者会打开或编辑某个文件时，才写出它的文件名**。不要为了证明某个说法去引用函数或行号；那是测试和评审的事。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:255
msgid ""
"**Describe the software as it is now.** What changed and how you checked "
"belong in the pull request or the release notes."
msgstr "**描述软件现在的样子。** 改了什么、如何验证的，应写在 pull request 或发布说明中。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:257
msgid ""
"**Leave out the details of any one installation**: its hosts, model ids, "
"accounts and measurements belong in that distribution's own "
"documentation."
msgstr "**不要写入任何一个具体部署的细节**：它的主机、模型 id、账号和测量数据属于该发行版自己的文档。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:259
msgid ""
"**Use the words in the [Glossary](glossary.md)**, and add a new term "
"there first."
msgstr "**使用[术语表](glossary.md)中的用词**，新术语先加到术语表里。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:261
msgid ""
"**Keep a paragraph to one idea.** When it piles up conditions, make it a "
"list or a table."
msgstr "**一个段落只讲一件事**。条件一多，就改成列表或表格。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:263
msgid ""
"**When a setting does not do what its name suggests, say so in one "
"sentence**, add it to [Settings that currently have no "
"effect](configuration.md#settings-that-currently-have-no-effect), and "
"open an issue."
msgstr ""
"**如果某个设置项的实际作用与名字不符，用一句话说明**，把它加到[目前不起作用的设置项](configuration.md#settings-"
"that-currently-have-no-effect)中，并提交一个 issue。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:268
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:270
msgid ""
"The site is published in English and Chinese, and a translation is "
"attached to each English paragraph. Update the Chinese in the same pull "
"request; [Translating the Docs and the Console](translations.md) explains"
" how."
msgstr ""
"站点以英文和中文发布，译文挂在每个英文段落上。请在同一个 pull request "
"中更新中文；做法见[翻译文档与控制台](translations.md)。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:274
msgid "Proposing a change"
msgstr "提出改动"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:276
msgid ""
"**Branch off `dev`, not `main`.** Pull requests target `dev`; CI runs on "
"pull requests against `main` and `dev`."
msgstr "**从 `dev` 开分支，而不是 `main`**。PR 提向 `dev`；针对 `main` 和 `dev` 的 PR 都会跑 CI。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:278
msgid ""
"**Name branches `<user>/<scope>/<feature-name>`**, e.g. `jane/routing"
"/weighted-fallback`."
msgstr ""
"**分支命名为 `<user>/<scope>/<feature-name>`**，例如 `jane/routing/weighted-"
"fallback`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:280
msgid ""
"**Write commit and pull-request titles as conventional commits**: "
"`type(scope): summary`, e.g. `fix(routing): keep the fallback route on "
"429`. Each pull request is squashed into one commit on `dev`, so its "
"title becomes the commit subject."
msgstr ""
"**提交和 pull request 的标题使用 conventional commits 格式**：`type(scope): "
"summary`，例如 `fix(routing): keep the fallback route on 429`。每个 pull "
"request 在 `dev` 上会被压缩成一个提交，因此它的标题就是提交的标题。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:284
msgid ""
"Keep a pull request to one feature or fix, update the docs in the same "
"change, and add tests for new behavior."
