#: ../developer/contributing.md:308
msgid ""
"Because CI runs `dbtest`, a change can pass `make test` and fail in CI. "
"When you touch storage (`apps/backend/serving/storage/`), SQL, the "
"schema, auth or a database test, run `make test-db-local`, or `make test-"
"db` against your own PostgreSQL, before you push. If a pull request shows"
" no CI run at all, check it for a merge conflict: a conflicted pull "
"request does not trigger the `pull_request` workflow."
msgstr ""
"由于 CI 会运行 `dbtest`，一个改动可能通过 `make test` 却在 CI "
"中失败。修改存储（`apps/backend/serving/storage/`）、SQL、数据库结构、认证或数据库测试时，请在推送之前运行 "
"`make test-db-local`，或针对你自己的 PostgreSQL 运行 `make test-db`。如果 pull request"
" 完全没有 CI 运行记录，先检查是否有合并冲突：有冲突的 pull request 不会触发 `pull_request` 工作流。"
